  "bulletin": {
    "id": "1178",
    "issue_date": "2026-06-14T02:15:00.000Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-06-14T02:09:37.862Z",
    "meteorologist": "Devid Dhakal",
    "analysis_np": "हाल नेपालमा उपल्लो वायुमण्डलमा रहेको पश्चिमी न्युन चापीय रेखा (trough), स्थानीय वायू तथा पूर्वीय वायूको समेत आंशिक प्रभाव रहेको छ।",
    "analysis_en": "At present, Nepal is under the partial influence of the upper-level western trough, local winds, and easterly winds.",
    "today_np": "देशको हिमाली भू-भागमा साधारणतया बादल लाग्नेछ, पहाडी भू-भाग तथा मधेश, बागमती, गण्डकी र लुम्बिनी प्रदेशका तराई भू-भागमा आंशिक बादल लाग्नेछ । सुदूरपश्चिम प्रदेशको तराई भू-भागमा मौसम मूख्यतया सफा रहनेछ । देशको हिमाली र पहाडी भू-भागका थोरै स्थानहरूमा मेघगर्जन/चट्याङ्ग सहित मध्यमसम्मको वर्षा/हिमपातको सम्भावना छ । मधेश प्रदेश, बागमती, गण्डकी र लुम्बिनी प्रदेशका तराई भू-भागका एक-दुई स्थानमा मेघगर्जन/चट्याङ्ग सहित मध्यमसम्मको वर्षाको सम्भावना छ ।",
    "today_en": "Generally cloudy conditions are likely over the Himalayan region of the country, while partly cloudy conditions are likely over the hilly region and the Terai areas of Madhesh, Bagmati, Gandaki, and Lumbini Provinces. The Terai region of Sudurpashchim Province is expected to remain mainly fair. There is a possibility of moderate rainfall/snowfall accompanied by thunder and lightning at a few places in the Hilly and Himalayan regions of the country. There is also a possibility of moderate rainfall accompanied by thunder and lightning at one or two places in the Terai areas of Madhesh, Bagmati, Gandaki, and Lumbini Provinces.",
    "tomorrow_np": "कोशी, मधेश, बागमती र गण्डकी प्रदेशमा आंशिक बादल लाग्नेछ । लुम्बिनी , कर्णाली र सुदूरपश्चिम प्रदेशको  हिमाली र पहाडी भू-भागमा आंशिक बादल लाग्नेछ । लुम्बिनी र सुदूरपश्चिम प्रदेशको तराई भू-भागमा मौसम मूख्यतया सफा रहनेछ। कोशी प्रदेशका थोरै स्थानहरूमा मेघगर्जन/चट्याङ्ग सहित मध्यम वर्षा/हिमपातको सम्भावना छ। बागमती र गण्डकी प्रदेश तथा लुम्बिनी, कर्णाली र सुदूरपश्चिम प्रदेशका हिमाली भू-भागका एक-दुई स्थानमा मेघगर्जन/चट्याङ्ग सहित हल्का वर्षा/हिमपातको सम्भावना छ । मधेश प्रदेशको पनि एक-दुई स्थानमा मेघगर्जन/चट्याङ्ग सहित मध्यमसम्मको वर्षाको सम्भावना छ ।",
    "tomorrow_en": "Partly cloudy conditions are likely over Koshi, Madhesh, Bagmati, and Gandaki Provinces. The Hilly and Himalayan regions of Lumbini, Karnali, and Sudurpashchim Provinces are also likely to experience partly cloudy conditions. The Terai regions of Lumbini and Sudurpashchim Provinces are expected to remain mainly fair. There is a possibility of moderate rainfall/snowfall accompanied by thunder and lightning at a few places in Koshi Province. There is also a possibility of light rainfall/snowfall accompanied by thunder and lightning at one or two places in Bagmati and Gandaki Provinces, as well as in the Himalayan regions of Lumbini, Karnali, and Sudurpashchim Provinces. Additionally, moderate rainfall accompanied by thunder and lightning is likely at one or two places in Madhesh Province.",
    "special": ""
  }
}
